WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.250
- WELCOME TO…

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:03.500
- [Audience:] “Which Teams Are Good?”

00:00:03.583 --> 00:00:05.875
- Today’s guests are from the only teams we know are good: 

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:06.625
The Patriots.

00:00:06.791 --> 00:00:09.458
- You told me this was an indoor lacrosse game.

00:00:09.458 --> 00:00:10.000
- The Ravens.

00:00:10.208 --> 00:00:13.333
- I will destroy this game and redefine it in my image.

00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:14.500
- And the Niners.

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:16.500
- [Audience member:] It should be the Seahawks.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:18.166
- Please welcome your host, KIRK COUSINS!

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:18.875
- Bad.

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:19.583
- I think good?

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:21.208
- There can only be one purple team.

00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:23.041
- Guys, the game hasn’t even started yet.

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:27.250
First up, ARE THE EAGLES GOOD?

00:00:27.416 --> 00:00:29.125
- No, but they will win the division.

00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:29.791
- CORRECT.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.250
- Is, is this all you needed us for?

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.875
- NEXT UP: ARE THE STEELERS GOOD?

00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:36.375
- Myles Garrett messed with their heads, but I will mess with their minds.

00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:37.791
- Yikes, OK the RAMS.

00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:39.125
- No, I think?

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:42.500
- The correct answer is, “We don’t think so, but it feels weird to say out loud.”

00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:43.750
OK...LIGHTNING ROUND! 

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:44.750
RAIDERS.

00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:45.666
- Yeah, maybe.

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:46.333
- Hell yeah, man.

00:00:46.375 --> 00:00:47.416
- COWBOYS.

00:00:47.416 --> 00:00:48.375
- No.
- No.
- No.

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:49.291
- TEXANS.

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:49.916
- HA HA.

00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:52.583
- You’ve won this battle, but I will win the war.

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:57.000
- And Lamar wins! Stay tuned for our next game show: “THE NFL’S KAP WORKOUT.”

00:00:58.166 --> 00:00:59.791
- WE PLANNED THIS IN A DAY. 

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:03.541
 - Alright, listen up men.

00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:05.458
Sometimes you hit the subscribe button,

00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:07.708
and sometimes the subscribe button, it hits you.

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.708
But the important thing is to smash that like button in your dream.

00:01:10.708 --> 00:01:11.708
- [Producer:] Alright Kirk, that's, we're good—

00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:15.166
- THE ONLY COMMENT SECTION THAT YOU SHOULD CARE ABOUT IS 
THE ONE INSIDE YOUR HEART.

